OL,4,CUK-EU deal won't lower prices        W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe prime minister made a lot of the W5
OL,7,GUK's new deal with the EU cutting    W5
OL,8,Gcosts for business and consumers     W5
OL,9,Gduring tough times.                  W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GIn another world, Andy Burnham would W5
OL,12,Ghave loved for the nation's          W5
OL,13,Gsupermarkets to clearly announce     W5
OL,14,Gthat they could cut food prices as a W5
OL,15,Gresult of this latest agreement on   W5
OL,16,Gfood exports.                        W5
OL,17,                                      W5
OL,18,GAnd while grocers have very much     W5
OL,19,Gwelcomed Friday's announcement, they W5
OL,20,Ghave notably not committed to price  W5
OL,21,Gcuts as a direct result of this move.W5
